# UI migration screenshots
# baseline/ IS committed — it is the reference the whole migration compares against.
# current/ and diff/ are regenerated on every page commit, so they stay out of git.
docs/migration/screenshots/current/
docs/migration/screenshots/diff/
docs/migration/screenshots/*-run.json
docs/migration/screenshots/compare.json

# Misc
*.tsbuildinfo
.cache/
